OL,3,GNEWSA'Poor standard' apartment plans
OL,4,Arefused
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to turn unused office space into
OL,7,Fresidential apartments has been refused
OL,8,Fdue to the perceived "poor standard" of
OL,9,Fthe proposed accommodation.
OL,11,FMiddlesbrough Council refused the
OL,12,Fapplication from Supreme Properties to
OL,13,Fchange the TAD Centre on Ormesby Road
OL,14,Ffrom commercial space to 16 apartments.
OL,16,FThe applicant said their aim was to
OL,17,Fcreate a hybrid hotel and self-catering
OL,18,Faccommodation for contractors working
OL,19,Fin the area.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
