OL,3,GNEWSA'Poor standard' apartment plans
OL,4,Arefused
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the refusal the planning team said
OL,7,Fthe proposal had "limited internal
OL,8,Fcommunal space", no private outdoor
OL,9,Famenity space and lacked an adequate
OL,10,Fbin store.
